Exceptions

The MIT license above does not cover the following paths. They are
Tangled brand assets and site content under `license-brand`
(SPDX identifier: LicenseRef-Tangled-Brand), except for third-party
material inside them, such as `blog/public/avatars/` and posts written by
guest authors, which stays with its owners:

  web/src/lib/components/icons/DollyCheck.svelte
  blog/
  jobs/
  cmd/dolly/
  web/src/lib/components/landing/
  web/src/lib/components/ui/logotype.ts
  web/src/lib/components/ui/Logo.svelte
  web/src/lib/components/ui/Logo.stories.svelte
  web/src/lib/components/ui/AnimatedLogo.svelte
  web/src/routes/company/
  web/src/routes/compare/
  web/src/routes/home/
  web/src/routes/privacy/
  web/src/routes/terms/
  web/static/og-image.png
  web/static/tangled_og.png
  web/static/llms.txt
  docs/public/favicon.svg
  docs/public/apple-touch-icon.png
  status/static/favicon.svg
  status/static/logos/
  status/src/logotype.ts
  status/src/footer.ts
  ogre/src/components/shared/logo.tsx
  localinfra/pds-theme.css

The same applies to every file generated from them, including the logos
that `cmd/dolly` writes to `web/static/logos/`, `blog/public/logos/` and
elsewhere.

Third-party fonts fetched at build time (Timeless Sans, IBM Plex Mono) are
not part of this repository and keep their own licenses. They are not
covered by the MIT license or `license-brand`.
